  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilient Infrastructure Development Facility Plus - (CRIDF+)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Climate Resilient Infrastructure Development Facility Plus - (CRIDF+) is a component of Regional Transboundary Water Resources Programme - Phase 3 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;2,874,449. This project benefits South of Sahara, regional. It works in the following sector(s): River basins development, Environmental policy and administrative management, Flood prevention/control, Water sector policy and administrative management, Water resources conservation (including data collection).</narrative>
  </description>
